      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is completely understandable why you feel trapped when the numbers just don't align in your favor. When the system itself feels rigged against you, the idea of fighting it becomes utterly pointless. Instead of focusing on \"winning\" the math, perhaps it's time to focus on finding a way to *stop* the bleeding, even if that means making a different kind of calculation. Consider what small, immediate relief—like finding a temporary financial or emotional safety net—could give you a break from the relentless pressure.",
